{%- comment -%}
  Scrolling trust-icon strip ("Zero additives / GMO-Free / Gluten-Free" with small icons) between two thin grey lines. Endless left-scroll, a little faster on phones.
  EDIT YOUR ITEMS BELOW. One item = icon link ||| text. Put @@ on its own line between items.
  The icon links start as Metabolae's own files so the strip is an exact copy straight away.
  Before you go live, download them, upload them to your own store (Content > Files) and paste your links here instead, so they keep working and are yours. Also replace the text, because it describes Metabolae's product.
  mb_repeat = how many times the list is repeated along the strip (5 = same as Metabolae). mb_text_color = text. mb_bg = strip background. mb_border = the two thin lines.
  mb_icon_filter = the colour of the icons. The icons are black/grey pictures, and this filter turns them dark brown like Metabolae. Write none to show the icons exactly as uploaded.
  These colours are locked, so the theme cannot turn them black.
  Do not use a straight apostrophe (') in the text, use &#39; instead. Do not type three | in a row inside an item except as the separator.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mb_text_color = '#000000' -%}
{%- assign mb_bg = '#ffffff' -%}
{%- assign mb_border = '#cccccc' -%}
{%- assign mb_icon_filter = 'brightness(0) saturate(100%) invert(19%) sepia(48%) saturate(1450%) hue-rotate(10deg) brightness(92%) contrast(97%)' -%}
{%- assign mb_repeat = 5 -%}
{%- capture mb_data -%}
https://metabolae.com/cdn/shop/files/metabolae-no-additives.webp?v=1773592010&width=32 ||| Zero additives
@@
https://metabolae.com/cdn/shop/files/metabolae-non-gmo.webp?v=1773592010&width=32 ||| GMO-Free
@@
https://metabolae.com/cdn/shop/files/metabolae-gluten-free.webp?v=1773592010&width=32 ||| Gluten-Free
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign mb_items = mb_data | split: '@@' -%}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" onload="this.onload=null;this.rel='stylesheet'">
<noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600&display=swap"></noscript>

<style>
.page-width:has(>.mb-mq){max-width:none;padding:0}
.mb-mq,.mb-mq *,.mb-mq *::before,.mb-mq *::after{box-sizing:border-box}
.mb-mq{display:block;margin:0;padding:4px 0;overflow:hidden;border-top:1px solid var(--mb-mq-bd,#ccc);border-bottom:1px solid var(--mb-mq-bd,#ccc);font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.8;letter-spacing:.6px;text-align:left}
@media screen and (min-width:750px){.mb-mq{font-size:16px}}
.mb-mq__w{position:relative;width:100%;overflow:hidden}
.mb-mq__tr{display:flex;gap:50px;align-items:center;white-space:nowrap;animation:mb-mq-scroll 16s linear infinite}
.mb-mq__it{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.mb-mq__i{display:block;width:28px;height:28px;max-width:none;margin:0;border:0;border-radius:0;object-fit:contain;filter:var(--mb-mq-f,none)}
.mb-mq .mb-mq__t{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13.3px;font-weight:700;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:.6px;text-transform:none;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--mb-mq-c,#000)!important;-webkit-text-fill-color:var(--mb-mq-c,#000)!important}
@media screen and (max-width:769px){
.mb-mq .mb-mq__t{font-size:11.4px}
.mb-mq__tr{animation-duration:8s}
}
@keyframes mb-mq-scroll{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
</style>

<section class="mb-mq" style="--mb-mq-c:{{ mb_text_color }};--mb-mq-bd:{{ mb_border }};--mb-mq-f:{{ mb_icon_filter }};background:{{ mb_bg }}!important">
  <div class="mb-mq__w">
    <div class="mb-mq__tr" style="color:{{ mb_text_color }}">
      {%- for mb_r in (1..mb_repeat) -%}
        {%- for mb_item in mb_items -%}
          {%- assign mb_f = mb_item | split: '|||' -%}
          {%- assign mb_icon = mb_f[0] | strip -%}
          {%- assign mb_name = mb_f[1] | strip -%}
      <div class="mb-mq__it"{% if mb_r > 1 %} aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}><img class="mb-mq__i" src="{{ mb_icon }}" width="32" height="32" alt="{% if mb_r > 1 %}{% else %}{{ mb_name | escape }}{% endif %}" decoding="async"><span class="mb-mq__t">{{ mb_name }}</span></div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
